# Chapter One board. Clears Otto, and turns the town's only suspect into the
# town's only witness.

board ch1_midnight
  title "The first floor: who was at the tower at midnight?"
  requires clue.otto_alibi clue.tansy_saw clue.ferry_log clue.fish_pail clue.midnight_figure clue.pip_hungry
  text "At midnight, {p1} climbed Tower Green"
  text "carrying {p2}."
  text "Not to steal, but to {p3}."
  text "The ferry log puts him there {p4},"
  text "and {p5} watched the whole of it"
  text "from the harbour wall."
  pool people token.otto token.tansy token.iris token.maribel token.nona
  pool objects token.fish_pail token.picks token.lantern token.ledger
  pool motives token.feed_pip token.steal token.mend token.promise
  pool times token.after_midnight token.that_night token.last_spring token.three
  blank p1 answer token.otto pool people from clue.otto_alibi clue.midnight_figure
  blank p2 answer token.fish_pail pool objects from clue.fish_pail clue.otto_alibi
  blank p3 answer token.feed_pip pool motives from clue.pip_hungry clue.tansy_saw
  blank p4 answer token.after_midnight pool times from clue.ferry_log clue.midnight_figure
  blank p5 answer token.tansy pool people from clue.tansy_saw clue.pip_hungry
  feedback grouped
  on_solved cut ch1_hue_blue
